tion>
<section class="section section--soft founder-editorial"><div class="container story-block__grid story-block__grid--reverse"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">REFLECTION & IMPROVEMENT</p><h2>Progress needs time to be reviewed, not only spent.</h2><p>One practice I value is creating time to review the work behind me before rushing into what comes next. Reflection makes it easier to see what moved forward, what did not work, what should change and where more attention is needed.</p><p>Time is one of our most limited resources. Giving yourself a quiet moment to review how it was used can turn experience into better decisions and create space for new ideas.</p><p><strong>Muhammad-Dayyib Idris</strong></p></div><picture class="founder-media founder-media--large reveal"><source type="image/webp" srcset="<?= h(asset('images/founder/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection-480.webp')) ?> 480w, <?= h(asset('images/founder/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection-768.webp')) ?> 768w, <?= h(asset('images/founder/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection-1200.webp')) ?> 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) min(100vw - 32px, 560px), 520px"><img class="founder-photo" src="<?= h(asset('images/founder/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection-768.jpg')) ?>" srcset="<?= h(asset('images/founder/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection-480.jpg')) ?> 480w, <?= h(asset('images/founder/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection-768.jpg')) ?> 768w, <?= h(asset('images/founder/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection/muhammad-dayyib-idris-reflection-1200.jpg')) ?> 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) min(100vw - 32px, 560px), 520px" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" alt="Muhammad-Dayyib Idris in a reflective work setting."></picture></div></section>
