, adapt and continue with better understanding.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p><strong>Go looking for opportunity.</strong><br>People cannot respond to work they never encounter. Share the idea, enter new rooms, speak to people, ask questions and look actively for the opportunities that match what you are building.</p></div></div><p class="founder-book-note">Book from the journey - coming soon</p></div></div></section>
